# Lets search tools that read this file, such as ripgrep and Claude Code's Grep, into the
# copies of the dependencies' docs that harnesspm writes to .harnesspm/docs/, which
# .gitignore lists. The rest of .harnesspm/ stays out of search. See docs/rules/harness.md.
!/.harnesspm/
/.harnesspm/*
!/.harnesspm/docs/
